  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extension of the existing water supply system in Niamey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is defined as the extension of the existing water supply system in Niamey through the rehabilitation of an existing raw water intake, the development, construction, equipping, subsequent commissioning and operation of a new drinking water treatment plant with a capacity of 40,000 m3/day (Goudel IV), and the extension and improvement of the current transmission and distribution network.</narrative>
  </description>
